[
    {
        "id": "atmo.tab",
        "type": "tab",
        "label": "Atmoph Windows",
        "disabled": false,
        "info": "Office-left Atmoph Window 2.\n\nOn at good morning, off at good night, view advanced on the hour and half hour.\nViews in China, Hong Kong, Singapore and Macau are skipped by geocoded country\ncode. Japan is on an always-allow list and cannot be blocked. Anything that does\nnot geocode is shown, never skipped.\n\nThe last 100 views are kept in flow context 'views' with location, country and\nthumbnail, which is how 'too city like' and 'beachy' get turned into blocklist\nentries. Edit the blocklist in the BLOCKLIST change node and deploy.\n\nMeasured on 29 Aug 2026:\n- location lags the view name by about 4ms, so the 5s settle is ample.\n- pressing next view on the left moves all three windows: right follows about\n  5s later, middle about 30s later. They are one panorama, so blocking a view\n  here blocks it on all three.",
        "env": []
    },
